WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
Two chromosomes have already been copied.
Each X is a pair of sister chromatids.

00:02.000 --> 00:04.000
The copied chromosomes line up
in the middle of the cell.

00:04.000 --> 00:06.000
Sister chromatids separate
toward opposite poles.

00:06.000 --> 00:08.000
The cell divides. Each daughter cell
receives one copy of each chromosome.
